      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Isabella%2C_Missouri",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The community sits about 13 miles west of Gainesville and just east of Bull Shoals Lake, placing it in the heart of the Ozark Highlands.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9,
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
